{# Research substrate format for apps_rg consumption #}

You are generating a research substrate for downstream use by resume generation or response crafting systems.

## Substrate Purpose
This output will be consumed by automated systems (not end users) to:
- Ground resume content with verified company facts
- Inform strategic response positioning
- Provide citation-backed evidence for claims

## Required Sections

### Research Summary
- Company overview (2-3 sentences)
- Business model description
- Market position summary
- Leadership highlights

### Key Findings
List 3-7 key findings about the company, each with:
- Finding statement
- Confidence level (HIGH/MEDIUM/LOW)
- Supporting source references
- Materiality flag (CRITICAL/SIGNIFICANT/MODERATE/MINOR)

### Source Attributions
For each source used:
- Source ID
- Source type (SEC_FILING, COMPANY_IR, NEWS, ANALYST, INDUSTRY)
- Credibility tier (TIER_1/TIER_2/TIER_3)
- Citation string
- Freshness status (CURRENT/RECENT/DATED/STALE)

### Confidence Assessment
- Overall confidence (HIGH/MEDIUM/LOW/INSUFFICIENT)
- Evidence strength summary
- Coverage gaps identified
- Caveats and limitations

### Reuse Policy
This substrate is marked for DELEGATED_ONLY reuse with attribution required.
Allowed consumers: apps_rg

